Pick from 14 different text-to-speech engines instead of being locked to on=
e
No billing. No caps. Your audio never touches a server.
To get started: git clone the repo, run bun install, then bun run desktop. =
It auto-configures all Python dependencies on first launch.
The honest tradeoff: quality depends on your hardware and which engine you =
pick. But for language coverage and privacy, nothing else comes close right=
 now.
